# Go build artifacts not covered by the parent garden .gitignore.
# (Parent rules apply at the superproject level; submodule ignores must
# be declared locally to keep `go test` / `go run` clean output out of
# submodule diffs.)
*.exe
*.test
*.out

# Convenience binary built by `go run ./cmd/warmup` while iterating.
cmd/warmup/warmup.exe
warmup.exe